\section*{AI usage policy}
In this work, we used generative AI tools to refine theoretical arguments and mathematical claims, assist with proof writing, provide feedback on research methodology and experimental design, and interpret results. 
We have not used generative AI tools for generating synthetic datasets, implementing methods, translating content, or cleaning and reformatting datasets, and qualitative and thematic data analysis are not applicable to this work. 
Additionally, we used generative AI tools to edit the manuscript for readability. 
We have reviewed all AI-assisted work. 
Specifically, we independently checked mathematical claims and proofs, verified literature references against their original sources, and checked interpretations against experimental results. We take responsibility for the final content of this work, including text, claims or artifacts produced with the aid of generative AI.




